{"3244080": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "CarveLight", "steam_appid": 3244080, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [5137960], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A turn-based artillery game for up to four players, fought over ground you're all actively destroying. Nobody has a health bar, so the only way to win is to drop your enemies into the void.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Destroy EVERYTHING</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3244080/extras/6a31e1a305d9e9d3b46c1560f573bd10.poster.avif?t=1787755313\" width=1170 height=584 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3244080/extras/6a31e1a305d9e9d3b46c1560f573bd10.webm?t=1787755313\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3244080/extras/6a31e1a305d9e9d3b46c1560f573bd10.mp4?t=1787755313\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Blow up the world. Make a precision cut with the laser, or throw a Hail Mary with the laser grenade and see what's still standing once the dust settles. There is no cover here, because nothing survives being shot at.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Armored cars don't have health bars. No repairs. If you want someone gone, you take the ground out from under them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3244080/extras/bf0b793c9941c2cd255ce62737cd0d9f.avif?t=1787755313\" width=1232 height=90 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Bring Friends To Throw Around</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3244080/extras/81b7f197b7f6e394ebfac1157b0d026c.poster.avif?t=1787755313\" width=1170 height=584 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3244080/extras/81b7f197b7f6e394ebfac1157b0d026c.webm?t=1787755313\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3244080/extras/81b7f197b7f6e394ebfac1157b0d026c.mp4?t=1787755313\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Up to four players, online or passing a single controller around the couch. Make a car fly across the map. Yours or the enemy's. Some turns you launch a rival into the void. Some turns you launch yourself, and everyone gets to watch it happen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3244080/extras/bf0b793c9941c2cd255ce62737cd0d9f.avif?t=1787755313\" width=1232 height=90 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Share Your Maps</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3244080/extras/68f8120941c27ba87efd702b028df667.poster.avif?t=1787755313\" width=1170 height=584 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3244080/extras/68f8120941c27ba87efd702b028df667.webm?t=1787755313\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3244080/extras/68f8120941c27ba87efd702b028df667.mp4?t=1787755313\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Sculpt levels in the in-game editor and drop straight into a match on them without ever leaving the game. Publish the ones worth keeping to the Steam Workshop, where new arenas are one click away.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3244080/extras/bf0b793c9941c2cd255ce62737cd0d9f.avif?t=1787755313\" width=1232 height=90 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Hone Your Skills</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3244080/extras/fbdf5f4229f6a8862ffeba91817d2c8b.poster.avif?t=1787755313\" width=1170 height=584 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3244080/extras/fbdf5f4229f6a8862ffeba91817d2c8b.webm?t=1787755313\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3244080/extras/fbdf5f4229f6a8862ffeba91817d2c8b.mp4?t=1787755313\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Speeders wanted! Solo challenges are the hardest driving test in the game — knock every enemy car off the map as fast as you can. Finding a solution is only half the job. The other half is perfecting the execution.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Every run is scored on the global leaderboard, so there's always a name sitting one row above yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Or skip the scoring entirely: sandbox mode hands you unlimited weapons and an empty arena to take apart however you like.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3244080/extras/bf0b793c9941c2cd255ce62737cd0d9f.avif?t=1787755313\" width=1232 height=90 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">What's In The Box</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">✔ Turn-based artillery for up to <strong>4 players</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">✔ <strong>Fully destructible</strong>, physics-driven terrain</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">✔ Online and local couch <strong>multiplayer</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">✔ In-game map editor with <strong>Steam Workshop</strong> support</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">✔ A dozen-plus terrain-warping <strong>weapons</strong> and tools</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">✔ Deterministic simulation, full match replays</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">✔ <strong>Solo challenge</strong> puzzles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">✔ <strong>Sandbox mode</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Carve. Detonate. Last one driving wins.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A turn-based artillery game for up to four players, fought over ground you're all actively destroying. Nobody has a health bar, so the only way to win is to drop your enemies into the void.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Destroy EVERYTHING</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3244080/extras/6a31e1a305d9e9d3b46c1560f573bd10.poster.avif?t=1787755313\" width=1170 height=584 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3244080/extras/6