 you launch yourself, and everyone gets to watch it happen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3244080/extras/bf0b793c9941c2cd255ce62737cd0d9f.avif?t=1787755313\" width=1232 height=90 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Share Your Maps</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3244080/extras/68f8120941c27ba87efd702b028df667.poster.avif?t=1787755313\" width=1170 height=584 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3244080/extras/68f8120941c27ba87efd702b028df667.webm?t=1787755313\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3244080/extras/68f8120941c27ba87efd702b028df667.mp4?t=1787755313\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Sculpt levels in the in-game editor and drop straight into a match on them without ever leaving the game. Publish the ones worth keeping to the Steam Workshop, where new arenas are one click away.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3244080/extras/bf0b793c9941c2cd255ce62737cd0d9f.avif?t=1787755313\" width=1232 height=90 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Hone Your Skills</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3244080/extras/fbdf5f4229f6a8862ffeba91817d2c8b.poster.avif?t=1787755313\" width=1170 heig