nistic simulation, full match replays</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">✔ <strong>Solo challenge</strong> puzzles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">✔ <strong>Sandbox mode</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Carve. Detonate. Last one driving wins.</p>", "short_description": "CarveLight is a turn-based multiplayer artillery game fought on fully destructible terrain. Take turns piloting physics-driven cars, carve the battlefield apart with lasers, grenades, and force fields, and be the last one driving. Play solo, on the couch, or online.", "supported_languages": "English, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Simplified Chinese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3244080/04ce75e1455bc3c45ffac11fba7a0d74f3c0c9c3/header.jpg?t=1787755313", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3244080/334db2e8ccbc0f794c83cc75b67d1624f7de23ec/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787755313", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3244080/334db2e8ccbc0f794c83cc75b67d1624f7de23ec/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787755313", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.0 GHz or better<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> DirectX 12 Shader Model 6.0 or Vulkan 1.3 supporting GPU<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<s